<title>FINLAND: LATEST FORECASTS FOR FINNISH ECONOMIC INDICATORS.</title>
<headline>LATEST FORECASTS FOR FINNISH ECONOMIC INDICATORS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest consensus forecasts for</p>
<p>Finnish economic indicators:</p>
<p> Date  ----Key indicator-----------  average   range   previous</p>
<p> w.33  July jobless rate (lab min)    16.8%  16.7%/16.9%  16.5%</p>
<p> 15/8  July CPI yr/yr		     +1.3%  +1.1%/+1.5%  +1.2%</p>
<p> 15/8  July CPI mth/mth		   +0.1%  -0.1%/+0.3%  +0.2%</p>
<p> 15/8  June core inflation yr/yr	+0.7%  +0.5%/+0.8%  +0.5%</p>
<p> 15/8  June industry output yr/yr     +6.7%  +5.7%/+7.3%  +6.1%</p>
<p> w.34  June trade balance  (FIM bln)  +4.4    +3.5/+5.5   +4.7</p>
<p> w.34  June C/A (FIM bln)		 +2.2    +1.2/+3.2   +3.4</p>
<p>Forecasts by Merita Bank, OKOBANK, Postipankki, Interbank,</p>
<p>Alfred Berg and Protos.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
